d 'CVCOMBO': module to perform control-variable all-combinations robustness test
d
d  cvcombo enumerates all nonempty combinations of user-specified
d control variables and estimates each specification using a
d user-supplied method(). It supports regress, xtreg, logit,
d probit, reghdfe, and other compatible Stata estimators. Version
d 2.0.0 additionally provides automated paper-output facilities,
d including Specification Curve, Specification Matrix,
d coefficient-distribution figures, robustness summaries, and a
d Word-format robustness table. 
d
d KW: control variables
d KW: regression
d KW: logit
d KW: probit
d
d Requires: Stata version 15.1
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260925
d
d Author: Jiang ZhenYuan ,  School of Economics, Northwest Normal University
d Support: email kangjang504@@gmail.com
d
d Author: Zhang Na ,  School of Economics, Northwest Normal University
d Support: email zhangna@@nwnu.edu.cn
d
f cvcombo.ado
f cvcombo.sthlp
f cvcombo_specification_curve.gph
f cvcombo_specification_curve.png
f cvcombo_specification_curve.svg
f cvcombo_test_logit.dta
f cvcombo_test_regress.dta
f test_cvcombo.do
